{"id":"W86ff7f94860cdc2b12f0ea89","zh":"均方根值","en":"","name":"均方根值","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W86ff7f94860cdc2b12f0ea89","text":"均方根值","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S1e22fe4987ac67dadb9a","source_id":"P103","page":5,"page_end":5,"language":"zh","text":"从上述可知,主成分1主要对车体振动的整体状态进行控制,如均方根值、绝对均值、方根幅值等指标主要表征轨道不平顺幅值的整体波动状态;主成分2 主要控制车体的振动峰值大小,如峰峰值、峰值指标、 裕度指标、峭度指标等均反映了轨道不平顺波峰的尖锐程度 [13]。","citations":[{"source_id":"P103","page":5,"page_end":5}]},{"id":"S916b7c9149859d7920fb","source_id":"P103","page":7,"page_end":7,"language":"zh","text":"通过数据分析,得到以下研究结果: (1)轨道不平顺信号的绝对均值、均方根值、方根幅值统计参数对车体水平、垂向振动的各项指标都有十分重要的影响,控制车体的整体振动状态;其他时频特征参数对车体振动的不同状态起着不同的调节作用。","citations":[{"source_id":"P103","page":7,"page_end":7}]}],"sources":{"P103":{"id":"P103","title":"轨道不平顺作用下铁路列车车体振动状态的PCA-SVM预测分析","authors":"徐磊,陈宪麦","year":"2014","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8361.2014.07.003","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2014）","overview_slug":"2014-pca-svm-forecast-of-car-body-vibration-states-of-railway-locomotives-and-vehicles-under-the-action-o"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"反映不平顺幅值整体水平，在第一主成分中具有较大权重。","language":"zh","source_id":"P103","paper_slug":"2014-pca-svm-forecast-of-car-body-vibration-states-of-railway-locomotives-and-vehicles-under-the-action-o","title":"轨道不平顺作用下铁路列车车体振动状态的PCA-SVM预测分析","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"W2e74d5ad795380a199d98caa","name":"Root-mean-square value","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W2e74d5ad795380a199d98caa","name":"Root-mean-square value","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_s